            <span class="sp-slegend"><span><i class="sp-sk is-up"></i>Photos &amp; uploads ${spMB(st.uploadsBytes)}</span><span><i class="sp-sk is-db"></i>Database ${spMB(st.dbBytes)}</span></span>
